== E3: one rule of fixed rarity 2^-j (FV1; learner prior uniform on j = 1..14), n = 64, T = 300, 24 humans per j ==
   fires = problems whose human chain fires the rule; first = cost of the search that discovers the rule;
   defer: a rejection with 1/max lambda > n/4 waits (<= 5 waiting), conditioned on as "the rule fires in that run".
   | j | humans | fires (mean) | protocol | Q per human | first discovery cost (mean) | when fires = 1 | when fires >= 2 | deferrals |
