   | 4 | 24 | 295.0 | immediate | 10.7 | 10.0 (24) | - | 10.0 (24) | 0.0 |
   | 4 | 24 | 295.0 | defer | 10.7 | 10.0 (24) | - | 10.0 (24) | 0.0 |
   | 8 | 24 | 66.5 | immediate | 20.0 | 19.2 (24) | - | 19.2 (24) | 0.0 |
   | 8 | 24 | 66.5 | defer | 11.0 | 10.6 (24) | - | 10.6 (24) | 0.8 |
   | 10 | 24 | 19.2 | immediate | 20.2 | 19.5 (24) | - | 19.5 (24) | 0.0 |
   | 10 | 24 | 19.2 | defer | 6.0 | 5.8 (24) | - | 5.8 (24) | 0.8 |
   | 12 | 24 | 4.1 | immediate | 19.6 | 19.8 (23) | 1.5 (2) | 21.5 (21) | 0.0 |
   | 12 | 24 | 4.1 | defer | 4.1 | 4.3 (23) | 1.5 (2) | 4.5 (21) | 0.6 |
   | 14 | 24 | 1.1 | immediate | 18.0 | 26.6 (16) | 19.6 (8) | 33.5 (8) | 0.0 |
   | 14 | 24 | 1.1 | defer | 10.3 | 15.2 (16) | 19.6 (8) | 10.8 (8) | 0.2 |

== E4: how often a random decision list has rare and single-shot rules (exact binomial counts, no simulation) ==
   A rule of rarity j fires in a run of n fresh steps w.p. pi_j = 1-(1-2^-j)^n; over T problems it fires in Bin(T, pi_j) of them.
   Per rule: P(fires in exactly one problem) = single; P(fires, and 2^j > n) = rare-exercised; P(fires at all) = exercised.
   Priors on j: log-uniform = uniform on 1..d (d = 40); universal-type = P(j) proportional to 1/j^2 on 1..200.
   | prior | n | T | exercised | rare-exercised | single | single/exercised | 1/ln(nT) |
   |---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
   | log-uniform | 16 | 300 | 0.314 | 0.214 | 0.0361 | 0.115 | 0.118 |
   | log-uniform | 16 | 3000 | 0.397 | 0.297 | 0.0361 | 0.091 | 0.093 |
   | log-uniform | 64 | 300 | 0.364 | 0.214 | 0.0361 | 0.099 | 0.101 |
   | log-uniform | 64 | 3000 | 0.447 | 0.297 | 0.0361 | 0.081 | 0.082 |
   | log-uniform | 256 | 300 | 0.414 | 0.214 | 0.0361 | 0.087 | 0.089 |
   | log-uniform | 256 | 3000 | 0.497 | 0.297 | 0.0361 | 0.073 | 0.074 |
   | universal-type | 16 | 300 | 0.955 | 0.087 | 0.0054 | 0.006 | 0.118 |
   | universal-type | 16 | 3000 | 0.965 | 0.097 | 0.0034 | 0.004 | 0.093 |
   | universal-type | 64 | 300 | 0.962 | 0.053 | 0.0040 | 0.004 | 0.101 |
   | universal-type | 64 | 3000 | 0.970 | 0.060 | 0.0027 | 0.003 | 0.082 |
   | universal-type | 256 | 300 | 0.967 | 0.036 | 0.0031 | 0.003 | 0.089 |
   | universal-type | 256 | 3000 | 0.973 | 0.042 | 0.0022 | 0.002 | 0.074 |

